; The independent reference execution model (phase_plan.md P1).
;
; Deliberately outside lib/, which is "the whole synthesizable surface of this repository":
; a diagnostic model must never be picked up by an RTL source list, and it must stay
; independent of Hardcaml so that a disagreement with the RTL is evidence rather than a
; shared mistake (formatting_guide.md section 10.1, construction-plan.md section 9).
;
; Note the absence of `hardcaml` from (libraries). That is the point of this directory.
;
; Not installed: nothing outside this repository consumes it yet. Give it a public_name
; when the P3.4 host API needs to be depended on from elsewhere.

(library
 (name protemu_model)
 (libraries core)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane))
 (lint
  (pps ppx_js_style)))
